  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Operation: Tango",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9374/450x258/operation-tango-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787367600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9374-buy-operation-tango-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Zarknox",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/16480527-1686341937.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Super jeu à faire à deux ! La communication et la coopération sont vraiment au centre du jeu, et les énigmes sont très sympas à résoudre ensemble. On s’est vraiment bien amusés du début à la fin. Je recommande clairement si vous cherchez un bon jeu coop à deux."
    },
    {
      "game": "DragonSword : Awakening",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22405/450x258/dragonsword-awakening-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787367600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22405-buy-dragonsword-awakening-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Sethiel",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/3707538-1575217116.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It's a buy-to-play game, although it's quite similar to Genshin Impact. The story is pretty typical for this type of game, and all the characters can be unlocked without having to pay extra.\n\n\n\nThe mounts are cool and have their own unique features, but unfortunately many of them can only be obtained by paying. For example, the dragon is only available with the Deluxe Edition, and it's the only mount that allows free flight. The bonuses from different mounts also stack, so buying additional mounts gives you additional cumulative bonuses.\n\n\n\nIf you're interested in getting stronger, most of the grinding is done in dungeons, where you farm lots of armor pieces hoping to get the bonuses you need. By far the most useful one is the bonus that ignores enemy defense.\n\n\n\nI'd give it a 7.5/10."
    },
    {
      "game": "Forza Horizon 6",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19535/450x258/forza-horizon-6-xbox-series-x-s-pc-microsoft-store-cover.jpg?v=1787367600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19535-buy-forza-horizon-6-xbox-series-x-s-pc-microsoft-store/",
      "user": "Raptorial Bird",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/26947994-1753506290.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "A játék szép és jó de én többet vártam tőle! Mindenesetre, az árát megérte elővásárlással!\n\n\n\nDe sok a kihasználatlan lehetőség amit a Japán helyszín kínál!\n\n\n\nAz Instant Gaming árai verhetetlenek."
    },
    {
      "game": "Aven Colony",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/2165/450x258/aven-colony-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1787367600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/2165-buy-aven-colony-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-granny",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Just came across this game and for the price here you really can't lose! Very nice graphics. The usual colony/city builder challenges. Has a sandbox mode, which can be adjusted for difficulty, etc. May crash on startup and for me I needed to make some changes to my system (found instructions in the game's Discussion) and now it's working fine."
